            "vulnerability": "Missing allowance check in transferFrom",
            "reason": "The function overrides ERC20 transferFrom but never checks or decreases the allowance of msg.sender for sender. Any external account can call transferFrom(victim, attacker, amount) to transfer any amount of NOVO from a victim who has not approved the caller. The internal _transfer only enforces lock and blacklist checks and then moves tokens, so this is directly exploitable to steal all unlocked NOVO from any holder."
        },
